+| `rounded-full` pills | 92 | 0 (icon-only buttons are circles) | R7 |
+| radii of 22px and more | 43 | 0 | R7, R19 |
+| bold, semibold, extrabold | 167 | 0 bold; 600 on headings and figures only | R4, R18 |
+| glow and long shadows | 22 | 0 | R6 |
